#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Left click and drag the selection to move selected content.\n"
"Hold {0} to scale instead of move.\n"
"Right click and drag the selection to rotate selected content.\n"
"Hold Shift to rotate in steps.\n"
"Use arrow keys to move selected content by a single pixel."
msgstr ""
"Levi klik in poteg izbire za prestavljanje izbrane vsebine.\n"
"Drži {0} za povečanje namesto prestavljanja.\n"
"Desni gumb in poteg izbire za zavrtenje izbrane vsebine.\n"
"Pritisni Shift za vrtenje v korakih.\n"
"Uporabi smerne tipke za prestavljanje izbrane vsebine za posamezen piksel."

#: ../Pinta.Tools/Tools/MoveSelectionTool.cs:50
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Left click and drag the selection to move selection outline.\n"
"Hold {0} to scale instead of move.\n"
"Right click and drag the selection to rotate selection outline.\n"
"Hold Shift to rotate in steps.\n"
"Use arrow keys to move selection outline by a single pixel."
msgstr ""
"Levi klik in potek izbire za prestavitev očrtanja izbire.\n"
"Drži {0} da povečanje/pomanjšanje namesto prestavljanja.\n"
"Desni klik in poteg izbire za izbiro očrtanja izbire.\n"
"Shift za vrtenje v korakih.\n"
"Uporabi smerne tipke za prestavljanje izbranega očrtanja za posamezen pixel."

#. Translators: {0} is 'Ctrl', or a platform-specific key such as 'Command' on macOS.
#: ../Pinta.Tools/Tools/ShapeTool.cs:52
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Left click to draw a shape with the primary color.\n"
"Left click on a shape to add a control point.\n"
"Left click on a control point and drag to move it.\n"
"Right click on a control point and drag to change its tension.\n"
"Hold Shift to snap to angles.\n"
"Use arrow keys to move the selected control point.\n"
"Press {0} + left/right arrows to select control points by order.\n"
"Press Delete to delete the selected control point.\n"
"Press Space to add a new control point at the mouse position.\n"
"Hold {0} while pressing Space to create the control point at the exact same "
"position.\n"
"Hold {0} while left clicking on a control point to create a new shape at the "
"exact same position.\n"
"Press Enter to finalize the shape."
msgstr ""
"Levi klik za slikanje predmeta z osnovno barvo.\n"
"Levi klik na predmet za dodajanje nadzorne točke.\n"
"Levi klik na nadzorno točko in poteg za premik predmeta.\n"
"Desni klik na nadzorno točko in poteg za spremembo napetosti stranice.\n"
"Drži Shift za enakomerni izris predmeta.\n"
"Smerne tipke za premik nadzornih točk.\n"
"Pritisni {0} + levo/desno smerno tipko za izbiro nadzornih točk po vrstnem "
"redu.\n"
"Pritisni Delete za brisanje nadzorne točke.\n"
"Pritisni Preslednico za dodajanje nove nadzorne točke na položaju miške.\n"
"Drži {0} med pretiskom preslednice za ustvarjanje nadzorne točke na povsem "
"enakem položaju.\n"
"Drži {0} med levim klikom na nadzorno točko za ustvarjanje novega predmeta "
"na povsem enakem položaju.\n"
"Pritisni Enter za dokončanje predmeta."

